+Factory behaviour:
+
+- A config that fails to load or validate (YAML error, unknown team or table,
+  unknown or cyclic `depends_on`, bad schedule, name not matching the file)
+  is skipped: its DAG does not appear, the parse log has a
+  `Skipping pipeline config <path>: ...` error, and every other pipeline loads.
+- Every task runs in the `warehouse` pool (16 slots, `pools.json`). Critical
+  pipelines get an absolute priority weight of 100, standard ones 1, so when
+  the pool is full critical tasks are always queued first.
+- Without `schedule.minute`, the start minute is derived from a stable checksum
+  of the pipeline name, so it is the same on every parse.
+
